WEBVTT

00:01.625 --> 00:02.962
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.986 --> 00:04.321
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.345 --> 00:07.561
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.585 --> 00:13.145
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.145 --> 01:31.105
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.265 --> 01:34.505
=Episode 2=

01:35.280 --> 01:39.405
(Lingzhou, North Liang)

01:46.205 --> 01:47.205
Your Highness,

01:47.280 --> 01:48.960
why not get on the horse
with His Highness?

01:50.344 --> 01:50.981
Your Highness.

01:51.005 --> 01:52.005
No.

01:52.805 --> 01:53.464
Brother,

01:53.755 --> 01:54.755
I'm taking you back home.

02:04.055 --> 02:06.330
(Lingzhou)

02:10.180 --> 02:12.080
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

02:12.805 --> 02:13.520
Your Highness,

02:13.544 --> 02:14.201
let me carry His Highness.

02:14.225 --> 02:15.225
Keep your voice down.

02:15.330 --> 02:16.856
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)
His Highness's house is being cleaned up.

02:16.880 --> 02:17.507
His Lordship ordered

02:17.531 --> 02:19.371
that His Highness be sent
to his house instead.

03:59.905 --> 04:00.945
It's been three years.

04:02.880 --> 04:04.080
You must have had a hard time.

04:06.055 --> 04:07.041
I didn't.

04:07.065 --> 04:08.584
A sightseeing tour wasn't very hard.

07:01.930 --> 07:02.930
He's tired, too.

07:15.630 --> 07:16.655
Jiang Ni.

07:17.080 --> 07:19.359
It's been three years
and you're still so thin.

07:19.705 --> 07:23.113
(Jiang Ni, maid in Wutong House)

07:26.080 --> 07:27.080
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

07:31.504 --> 07:32.504
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

07:33.505 --> 07:34.505
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

07:37.705 --> 07:38.705
- My Lord.
- My Lord.

07:42.355 --> 07:43.585
Here comes Xu Xiao.

07:44.630 --> 07:45.944
My father likes to kill.

07:46.230 --> 07:47.230
If you don't hide,

07:47.455 --> 07:49.280
I'm afraid you'll be killed.

07:53.980 --> 07:54.980
Here.

08:41.780 --> 08:42.864
He's still asleep?

08:43.380 --> 08:44.425
He was asleep just now.

08:44.980 --> 08:47.140
Young Master Longxiang
is accompanying him in the room.

08:57.105 --> 08:57.982
Look.

08:58.006 --> 09:00.430
Am I smartly dressed?

09:02.105 --> 09:02.956
Yes,

09:02.980 --> 09:04.300
unless you're observed carefully.

09:04.355 --> 09:05.435
What are you talking about?

09:05.530 --> 09:06.556
Unless I'm observed carefully?

09:06.580 --> 09:08.380
Don't you know
what kind of person my son is?

09:08.755 --> 09:09.755
He's quite fastidious.

09:09.980 --> 09:10.607
Come on.

09:10.631 --> 09:11.720
Have the maids freshen me up.

09:11.744 --> 09:12.744
- Quickly.
- Come on.

09:13.205 --> 09:14.205
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:18.180 --> 09:20.120
I see that many of the maids are new.

09:20.144 --> 09:20.682
Yes.

09:20.706 --> 09:22.130
Read out our family rules

09:22.264 --> 09:23.264
to them.

09:23.530 --> 09:24.530
All right.

09:26.880 --> 09:28.105
Listen carefully.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.624
When His Lordship meets His Highness,

09:31.380 --> 09:32.664
wise up.

09:36.305 --> 09:37.945
Even if His Lordship
were beaten to death,

09:39.055 --> 09:40.531
you would pretend you didn't see that.

09:40.555 --> 09:41.230
Right.

09:41.504 --> 09:43.065
You must keep this in mind.

09:43.504 --> 09:44.405
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:44.455 --> 09:45.455
Mm.

09:46.380 --> 09:47.380
Wait.

09:47.705 --> 09:48.705
Come closer.

09:49.530 --> 09:50.545
Look at me.

09:51.105 --> 09:52.664
Do I look amiable?

09:53.280 --> 09:55.440
- Please spare me, My Lord.
- Please spare me, My Lord.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.945
Leave me, all of you.

09:59.055 --> 10:00.055
- Yes.
- Yes.

10:15.905 --> 10:16.730
Dear son.

10:16.880 --> 10:17.880
You're awake?

10:19.380 --> 10:20.380
Are you feeling better?

10:23.130 --> 10:23.981
It's been three years.

10:24.005 --> 10:25.005
Ah.

10:28.185 --> 10:29.640
Do you know what I suffered

10:29.664 --> 10:30.921
during the three years?

10:30.945 --> 10:31.682
Yes, yes.

10:31.706 --> 10:32.780
I'm sorry.

10:32.905 --> 10:33.480
I...

10:33.580 --> 10:35.545
Why did you force me to travel widely?

10:36.180 --> 10:37.180
You missed.

10:37.425 --> 10:38.355
Don't. Don't.

10:38.430 --> 10:39.430
Stop it!

10:39.624 --> 10:40.720
What's the point of losing your temper?

10:40.744 --> 10:41.322
Take a rest first.

10:41.346 --> 10:42.384
Let's talk after that.

10:43.185 --> 10:44.131
You were just back.

10:44.155 --> 10:45.155
Don't. Don't.

10:45.630 --> 10:46.357
Stop running.

10:46.381 --> 10:47.381
- You're not wearing your shoes.
- Stop running.

10:47.405 --> 10:48.201
Put on your shoes.

10:48.225 --> 10:48.761
Put them on.

10:48.785 --> 10:50.255
Don't get hurt.

10:51.430 --> 10:52.322
Don't touch it!

10:52.346 --> 10:53.585
It's quite expensive!

10:55.530 --> 10:57.730
Then I should apologize to you, Father.

10:59.280 --> 11:00.006
Don't. Don't.

11:00.030 --> 11:01.030
Ouch.

11:01.155 --> 11:02.555
Don't bother to apologize.

11:03.030 --> 11:05.360
D-D-Don't call me Father.
Call me by my name.

11:05.384 --> 11:07.081
It sounds closer.

11:07.105 --> 11:08.321
You're agile.

11:08.345 --> 11:09.240
Enough, son.

11:09.264 --> 11:10.080
Son.

11:10.225 --> 11:11.225
Son.

11:11.425 --> 11:12.555
It's very cold out here.

11:12.864 --> 11:14.855
Without shoes, you'll catch a cold.

11:15.130 --> 11:16.130
All right, then.

11:20.755 --> 11:21.755
Oh, no.

11:22.630 --> 11:24.024
It's worth three mansions.

11:36.905 --> 11:37.905
Let me close the door.

11:38.955 --> 11:39.881
After the door is closed,

11:39.905 --> 11:41.360
vent your anger however you like.

11:42.504 --> 11:43.664
In this way, you can also

11:53.255 --> 11:54.255
Again?

11:54.630 --> 11:55.401
Could you cut it out?

11:55.425 --> 11:55.961
What...?

11:55.985 --> 11:57.225
- What do I do?
- Wait a minute.

11:59.005 --> 12:00.205
I'll let you go today.

12:01.605 --> 12:03.144
But this isn't over.

12:03.680 --> 12:04.481
Wait and see.

12:04.505 --> 12:05.730
I will. I will.

12:08.430 --> 12:09.430
I'm tired.

12:09.480 --> 12:10.480
Tired?

12:10.805 --> 12:11.465
You're tired?

12:11.605 --> 12:12.605
Tired...

12:18.530 --> 12:19.384
Come on.

12:19.425 --> 12:20.425
Here.

12:20.780 --> 12:21.780
Be seated.

12:24.455 --> 12:25.130
Let me

12:25.455 --> 12:27.024
help you put on your shoes.

12:30.230 --> 12:31.681
You help your son put on his shoes?

12:31.705 --> 12:33.545
How embarrassing it will be
if others see this!

12:34.945 --> 12:35.682
Look.

12:35.706 --> 12:37.305
We're still close father and son.

12:37.345 --> 12:39.305
It's very polite of you, son.

12:40.955 --> 12:42.441
Brother, let me help you.

12:42.465 --> 12:43.465
I'll do it myself.

12:55.780 --> 12:56.425
Brother,

12:56.630 --> 12:57.630
you're no longer angry?

12:57.880 --> 12:58.880
I'm no longer angry.

13:01.024 --> 13:02.384
Three years was quite a long time.

13:06.255 --> 13:07.255
Say no more.

13:07.705 --> 13:08.705
It's getting late.

13:08.805 --> 13:10.225
Go back to your room and sleep.

13:10.830 --> 13:11.830
But Brother...

13:12.030 --> 13:13.255
I'm not leaving anymore.

13:13.730 --> 13:14.770
Let's go fishing tomorrow.

13:15.880 --> 13:16.880
Off you go.

13:17.455 --> 13:18.455
Wait.

13:18.905 --> 13:19.905
Say good night to Father.

13:22.455 --> 13:23.024
Father,

13:23.180 --> 13:24.240
I'm going to sleep. Good night.

13:24.264 --> 13:25.345
Go ahead.

13:33.730 --> 13:34.730
How do you feel now?

13:34.855 --> 13:35.895
Have you had enough sleep?

13:37.730 --> 13:38.730
I still feel tired.

13:39.005 --> 13:39.784
You do?

13:39.880 --> 13:40.945
Get more sleep, then.

13:41.355 --> 13:42.355
No.

13:42.655 --> 13:44.024
Something is confusing me.

13:44.105 --> 13:45.105
What is it?

13:45.880 --> 13:47.401
I want to see

13:47.425 --> 13:48.984
the captured veteran of West Chu.

13:50.155 --> 13:50.720
Now?

13:50.744 --> 13:51.744
Now.

13:53.755 --> 13:54.330
All right.

13:54.580 --> 13:55.305
I'll take you to see him.

13:55.480 --> 13:56.480
Wait for me out there.

13:57.780 --> 13:59.000
I'll get changed.

13:59.024 --> 14:00.784
Right, right.

14:06.155 --> 14:06.904
Somebody.

14:07.155 --> 14:08.705
Come and dress him up.

14:11.580 --> 14:12.580
Little Jiang Ni,

14:13.405 --> 14:14.521
don't come out

14:14.545 --> 14:15.545
until we leave.

14:15.705 --> 14:17.065
Keep your dagger carefully.

14:22.980 --> 14:23.980
Ouch.

14:43.755 --> 14:45.955
Xu Fengnian!

15:28.280 --> 15:29.330
Away you go.

15:29.430 --> 15:30.510
Don't bother to guard here.

15:31.355 --> 15:32.355
Leave.

15:32.805 --> 15:33.640
- Yes.
- Yes.

15:33.664 --> 15:34.556
Off you go. Quickly.

15:34.580 --> 15:35.580
Leave.

15:38.730 --> 15:39.856
Lead the way.

15:39.880 --> 15:40.880
Yes.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.600
It's Jiang Ni

15:48.624 --> 15:50.184
who is hiding under your bed, isn't it?

15:50.705 --> 15:51.840
I told you

15:51.864 --> 15:53.240
I would take care of my own maids

15:53.264 --> 15:54.042
and you should not interfere.

15:54.066 --> 15:55.240
Don't forget those who assassinated you

15:55.264 --> 15:56.384
were all from West Chu.

15:56.425 --> 15:57.705
Considering Jiang Ni's identity,

15:57.744 --> 15:58.641
she must be involved.

15:58.665 --> 16:00.521
Have you ever thought

16:00.545 --> 16:02.580
that maybe she portrayed you?

16:03.680 --> 16:04.680
All right.

16:04.755 --> 16:05.355
Fine.

16:05.755 --> 16:07.105
She's your maid.

16:07.255 --> 16:09.280
I won't interfere.

16:15.024 --> 16:16.024
Xu!

16:16.705 --> 16:17.705
Feng!

16:18.430 --> 16:19.430
Nian!

17:02.255 --> 17:03.264
Xu Xiao?

17:04.105 --> 17:05.265
Xu Xiao!

17:05.630 --> 17:07.761
Countless deceased soldiers
are watching you.

17:07.785 --> 17:09.321
You won't end up well.

17:09.345 --> 17:10.505
Don't let them just watch me.

17:10.680 --> 17:11.904
Ask them to come and fight me.

17:13.280 --> 17:14.081
Talk to him.

17:14.105 --> 17:15.105
Xu Xiao!

17:15.305 --> 17:18.156
Your son survived the first assassination,
but he won't survive a second one.

17:18.180 --> 17:19.321
Soon, someone will make you

17:19.345 --> 17:20.825
handle the funeral for him!

17:22.230 --> 17:23.230
All right.

17:25.680 --> 17:26.880
Are you afraid of death?

17:32.005 --> 17:33.985
When you assassinated me
outside Lingzhou,

17:35.580 --> 17:37.144
none of you could get away.

17:38.330 --> 17:39.440
In this case,

17:39.464 --> 17:40.704
you're not afraid of death.

17:45.005 --> 17:46.855
I've been thinking of one question.

17:48.480 --> 17:50.360
In Apricot Flower Wine Shop
outside of the town,

17:51.464 --> 17:53.305
why did you put down your broadsword?

17:57.505 --> 17:58.505
Oh no.

17:59.155 --> 18:00.630
It's the North Liang Cavalry.

18:08.224 --> 18:09.824
Now that you're not even
afraid of death,

18:10.080 --> 18:11.280
why did you surrender?

18:14.384 --> 18:15.400
I asked you to surrender

18:15.424 --> 18:16.424
and then you did.

18:17.230 --> 18:18.710
You were quite obedient, weren't you?

18:23.955 --> 18:24.680
Xu Xiao.

18:24.704 --> 18:25.704
What?

18:25.955 --> 18:28.305
Do you remember
the Halberd Troops of West Chu?

18:28.505 --> 18:29.545
I certainly do.

18:30.455 --> 18:31.975
During the War of Destroying West Chu,

18:32.184 --> 18:33.505
none of the Halberd Troops

18:33.655 --> 18:34.840
surrendered.

18:34.864 --> 18:35.984
They all died in the war.

18:36.755 --> 18:37.755
That's right.

18:38.305 --> 18:39.282
In this case,

18:39.306 --> 18:40.906
you should have fought me
until you died.

18:41.780 --> 18:43.260
Why did you surrender?

18:48.530 --> 18:49.570
You don't confess, do you?

18:51.005 --> 18:52.005
Very well.

18:52.455 --> 18:53.904
Let me guess.

18:59.255 --> 19:01.580
You think the assassination against me
isn't over yet.

19:02.255 --> 19:04.241
Even if I survived outside of the town,

19:04.265 --> 19:06.025
I would still end up dead.

19:06.785 --> 19:07.985
With a certain outcome,

19:08.255 --> 19:10.505
you consider staying alive.

19:13.930 --> 19:15.155
Or else,

19:15.905 --> 19:18.120
you want to see how sad Xu Xiao will be

19:18.144 --> 19:19.664
after I die.

19:23.930 --> 19:25.545
Maybe I'm just afraid of death.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.384
You're abasing yourself already.

19:28.605 --> 19:30.785
Sounds like you don't want me
to keep guessing.

19:35.880 --> 19:37.184
This is Lingzhou.

19:37.455 --> 19:38.585
The center of North Liang.

19:39.230 --> 19:40.230
How can you kill me?

19:44.605 --> 19:45.955
North Liang Army, right?

19:48.705 --> 19:50.105
You only started the assassination.

19:50.855 --> 19:52.904
The mole will continue the conspiracy.

19:57.655 --> 19:59.424
You're not a playboy.

20:01.355 --> 20:02.704
Why am I not?

20:04.455 --> 20:06.855
I'm the number one playboy, aren't I?

20:07.505 --> 20:08.825
Everybody knows that.

20:11.230 --> 20:12.505
Xu Fengnian.

20:13.405 --> 20:15.745
You're so perfectly disguised.

20:16.055 --> 20:17.704
Looks like I've guessed right.

20:18.605 --> 20:20.080
Could you please let me know?

20:21.230 --> 20:22.530
Who, in North Liang Army,

20:32.205 --> 20:33.224
Torture me.

20:34.330 --> 20:35.505
I don't have to.

20:36.505 --> 20:38.144
I'll wait until he comes to me.

20:44.130 --> 20:44.831
I'm done talking.

20:44.855 --> 20:45.855
Ah?

20:45.980 --> 20:46.756
- You are?
- Mm.

20:46.780 --> 20:47.530
All right, then.

20:47.780 --> 20:49.065
Let's go have a private talk.

20:51.530 --> 20:52.224
Xu Xiao!

20:52.505 --> 20:53.505
Xu Fengnian!

20:53.530 --> 20:54.905
You'll die!

20:55.780 --> 20:58.180
You'll die!

21:09.970 --> 21:12.530
(Chu)

21:15.530 --> 21:17.272
(Chu)

21:18.480 --> 21:19.555
I'm too young

21:20.605 --> 21:22.265
to appreciate

21:22.830 --> 21:24.455
the glory of the Halberd Troops.

21:26.605 --> 21:29.184
You bought me food and drink.

21:30.080 --> 21:31.480
I'm giving you this flag in return.

21:50.330 --> 21:54.305
(Chu)

21:58.355 --> 22:01.005
(Chu)

22:15.480 --> 22:16.624
As for your portrait,

22:16.855 --> 22:18.430
I'll give you an explanation.

22:19.355 --> 22:20.561
From tomorrow on,

22:20.585 --> 22:22.561
I'll be a playboy who does nothing,

22:22.585 --> 22:24.305
but idles away his time
in pleasure-seeking.

22:24.455 --> 22:25.781
I don't need an explanation.

22:25.805 --> 22:27.704
You don't need
to aggrieve yourself, do you?

22:27.930 --> 22:29.120
Rich playboys

22:29.144 --> 22:30.985
are good at being on the tiles.

22:31.280 --> 22:32.360
I don't aggrieve myself.

22:32.384 --> 22:33.384
I know.

22:33.530 --> 22:34.704
You do everything

22:34.880 --> 22:36.624
to pretend that you're clumsy.

22:37.055 --> 22:38.880
You're already doing a good job.

22:38.904 --> 22:40.065
But others

22:40.330 --> 22:41.585
may not believe that.

22:41.955 --> 22:42.985
Who doesn't believe that?

22:44.330 --> 22:45.801
Do you remember

22:45.825 --> 22:47.785
why I asked you
to travel widely three years ago?

22:48.355 --> 22:49.761
To get away from the marriage
granted by the royal family.

22:49.785 --> 22:50.785
Exactly.

22:50.830 --> 22:52.321
Princess Suizhu

22:52.345 --> 22:53.745
is always mollycoddled.

22:54.180 --> 22:56.200
If the royal family really believes

22:56.224 --> 22:57.400
that you're a playboy

22:57.424 --> 22:58.481
with a tattered reputation,

22:58.505 --> 22:59.358
will they still

22:59.382 --> 23:00.585
summon you to the capital city

23:00.730 --> 23:02.025
and marry her?

23:05.080 --> 23:06.080
Fengnian,

23:07.080 --> 23:08.680
you're my son,

23:09.384 --> 23:11.745
the heir of North Liang Cavalry.

23:11.955 --> 23:13.265
Considering your role,

23:13.330 --> 23:16.224
you can't get away from schemes.

23:17.880 --> 23:19.800
Who told you I would inherit
North Liang Cavalry?

23:20.480 --> 23:22.406
A-Are you going to keep hiding?

23:22.430 --> 23:23.585
H-Hiding away?

23:24.355 --> 23:26.120
Who can I pass North Liang Cavalry to?

23:26.144 --> 23:28.001
Except you, who else can I pass it to?

23:28.025 --> 23:28.640
I'm hungry.

23:28.664 --> 23:29.904
I don't want to argue with you.

23:30.855 --> 23:31.855
Fine.

23:32.005 --> 23:34.265
Let's go have dinner.

23:35.930 --> 23:36.585
You know what?

23:36.624 --> 23:39.160
I asked the cooks
to make deer tendons for you

23:39.184 --> 23:41.184
as well as fresh seafood.

23:41.224 --> 23:43.521
Fresh eggs

23:43.545 --> 23:47.985
and hot crystal dumplings.

23:48.505 --> 23:49.864
I'll have them sent

23:50.155 --> 23:51.265
to your room.

23:53.704 --> 23:55.055
I want sweet potatoes.

23:59.855 --> 24:00.855
Sweet potatoes?

24:02.480 --> 24:03.480
Old Huang!

24:03.680 --> 24:04.930
You're eating alone again.

24:10.530 --> 24:12.105
Go. Go fetch two bowls.

24:28.105 --> 24:29.105
Here.

24:36.530 --> 24:37.704
What are you doing?

24:38.265 --> 24:39.356
I just want some wine from you.

24:39.380 --> 24:40.820
Don't look as if I were killing you.

24:42.730 --> 24:44.001
Be careful. Don't spill any.

24:44.025 --> 24:45.345
- Or it'll be wasted.
- All right.

24:47.330 --> 24:48.330
Help yourself. Quickly.

24:48.605 --> 24:50.721
Old Huang always eats fast.

24:50.745 --> 24:51.920
Be quick, or you'll have nothing to eat.

24:51.944 --> 24:52.944
All right.

24:59.655 --> 25:00.655
Xu Xiao,

25:01.780 --> 25:02.961
when I was traveling for three years,

25:02.985 --> 25:05.025
Old Huang kept advising me
to practice martial arts.

25:07.530 --> 25:08.690
You asked him to, didn't you?

25:13.880 --> 25:15.305
During the three years,

25:15.805 --> 25:17.165
we got in a great deal of trouble.

25:18.680 --> 25:20.160
How much trouble was arranged by you?

25:21.480 --> 25:22.961
Most of the trouble

25:22.985 --> 25:24.155
was caused by yourself.

25:25.405 --> 25:26.430
Why did you do that?

25:27.980 --> 25:28.980
To make me temper myself?

25:30.530 --> 25:31.805
Man who travels far

25:32.184 --> 25:34.144
knows more.

25:38.680 --> 25:39.704
Old Huang

25:40.205 --> 25:41.904
ran away from White Fox

25:42.830 --> 25:44.980
because he wanted me
to face the assassination alone.

25:47.155 --> 25:48.435
You arranged it too, didn't you?

25:51.130 --> 25:52.680
He knew everything.

25:52.704 --> 25:53.704
Shut up.

25:55.830 --> 25:56.830
Look.

25:56.980 --> 25:58.436
You're so clever

25:58.460 --> 25:59.985
and scheming.

26:00.205 --> 26:03.130
You're born
to take over North Liang Cavalry.

26:03.855 --> 26:05.081
Save your breath.

26:05.105 --> 26:06.105
Enjoy the meat.

26:07.955 --> 26:09.041
Don't only focus on the meat.

26:09.065 --> 26:09.956
Let's have a drink.

26:09.980 --> 26:10.980
Yes, yes.

26:11.655 --> 26:12.655
Come on.

27:07.905 --> 27:09.384
I'm full.

27:10.105 --> 27:11.345
I'll sleep here tonight.

27:11.730 --> 27:12.730
What?

27:12.825 --> 27:14.825
Why will you sleep here?

27:15.755 --> 27:17.761
Tomorrow, I'll be a playboy again.

27:17.785 --> 27:20.065
Tonight, pretend I was still on a trip.

27:20.255 --> 27:21.630
Come on, son.

27:23.424 --> 27:25.055
Would you like to travel with me?

27:25.555 --> 27:26.955
I'll leave you alone.

27:48.905 --> 27:49.905
Are you exhausted?

27:51.430 --> 27:53.471
I was physically exhausted
when I traveled widely.

27:54.805 --> 27:56.224
When I'm back here,

27:56.704 --> 27:57.704
I'm mentally exhausted.

28:03.130 --> 28:05.144
You misunderstood something.

28:05.980 --> 28:06.980
What?

28:08.305 --> 28:09.880
It's not your father

28:10.230 --> 28:11.830
who wanted you to practice martial arts.

28:12.464 --> 28:13.780
But I thought

28:14.345 --> 28:16.585
if you got in trouble,

28:17.005 --> 28:18.765
you could protect yourself
with martial arts.

28:24.180 --> 28:25.230
Forget it.

28:26.230 --> 28:27.230
Say no more.

28:27.630 --> 28:28.561
We're going fishing tomorrow.

28:28.585 --> 28:29.705
- Old Huang, come over.
- Mm.

28:30.130 --> 28:31.130
Fishing?

28:31.830 --> 28:33.955
Someone in North Liang Army
wants to kill me.

28:34.355 --> 28:35.635
I must hook him.

29:51.655 --> 29:53.505
You drool when you sleep?

29:55.955 --> 29:57.144
Xu Fengnian!

29:57.455 --> 29:59.095
Don't get up.
You're not properly dressed.

30:05.505 --> 30:06.545
Give it back to me.

30:07.130 --> 30:08.704
Let's make a deal.

30:09.030 --> 30:10.521
You can assassinate me.

30:10.545 --> 30:12.521
But if you fail, you must give me money.

30:12.545 --> 30:13.944
You failed last night, didn't you?

30:14.355 --> 30:15.355
You...

30:17.330 --> 30:18.505
I'll take the money.

30:21.205 --> 30:23.065
Don't go too far.

30:25.080 --> 30:26.944
How many more coins will you take?

30:34.655 --> 30:35.864
Save as many coins as you can.

30:43.105 --> 30:44.105
Go.

30:44.380 --> 30:45.545
Go fishing with me.

30:47.480 --> 30:48.480
I won't.

30:54.780 --> 30:56.155
I can pay you.

30:57.955 --> 30:59.875
If you don't want the coins,
I'll take them back.

31:07.905 --> 31:09.425
You'll get them
when we reach the lake.

31:16.605 --> 31:20.130
(Tingchao Pavilion,
Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

31:32.580 --> 31:35.460
(Propitious Omens)

31:39.880 --> 31:42.205
(Tingchao Pavilion)

32:00.155 --> 32:03.255
(Hongshu, maid in Wutong House)

32:09.280 --> 32:15.555
(Tingchao Pavilion)

32:50.680 --> 32:52.265
Thank you for saving His Highness.

32:52.655 --> 32:54.081
As his maids,

32:54.105 --> 32:55.465
we can offer nothing to repay you.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.880
This is a fresh melon.

32:57.904 --> 32:58.904
It's very sweet.

32:59.355 --> 33:00.355
No, thanks.

33:04.905 --> 33:06.305
You don't like to talk?

33:07.255 --> 33:10.330
You've got a temper like Qingniao.

33:12.405 --> 33:13.424
That's her.

33:15.445 --> 33:18.853
(Qingniao, maid in Wutong House)

33:23.355 --> 33:24.664
You're so beautiful.

34:09.680 --> 34:11.360
You must have been waiting
for a long time.

34:14.830 --> 34:15.830
Brother.

34:20.705 --> 34:21.705
Let's do some fishing.

34:47.980 --> 34:49.130
Bait the hook.

35:09.355 --> 35:10.435
This is my younger brother,

35:11.155 --> 35:12.155
Xu Longxiang.

35:12.855 --> 35:13.855
You've met him.

35:19.105 --> 35:20.505
He's born with extraordinary power.

35:23.305 --> 35:24.585
This is Qingniao.

35:25.280 --> 35:26.545
This is Hongshu.

35:26.830 --> 35:27.989
They're my maids.

35:30.780 --> 35:31.780
And this...

35:31.805 --> 35:32.805
This is Jiang Ni.

35:33.780 --> 35:34.780
Pay me.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.304
Three maids?

35:48.080 --> 35:49.905
In Wutong House
where His Highness lives,

35:49.980 --> 35:51.780
there are more than 20 maids.

35:52.230 --> 35:55.030
They're just not needed for fishing.

35:57.955 --> 35:59.320
So many maids for you?

35:59.344 --> 36:00.744
I'm lucky to live such a good life.

36:05.555 --> 36:06.555
You're jealous of me?

36:09.025 --> 36:10.055
You promised me

36:10.744 --> 36:12.224
that I could enter Tingchao Pavilion.

36:13.655 --> 36:15.256
Tingchao Pavilion is back there.

36:15.280 --> 36:16.830
You can go whenever you want.

36:17.380 --> 36:18.585
For only two hours, though.

36:22.255 --> 36:24.025
I allowed you to get in,

36:24.380 --> 36:26.100
but you couldn't stay there
for a long time.

36:31.255 --> 36:32.425
Tell me what you want.

36:37.755 --> 36:39.344
First, I want to know your name.

36:41.855 --> 36:43.030
Nangong Puye.

36:49.744 --> 36:51.264
The Nangong Family of North Mang.

36:54.355 --> 36:55.585
That's weird.

36:57.030 --> 37:00.310
(Nangong Puye, swordswoman of North Mang)
You came to Liyang to learn martial arts?

37:01.755 --> 37:02.721
North Liang Cavalry of my family

37:02.745 --> 37:04.824
is what your emperor hates most.

37:05.830 --> 37:07.270
Are you going to break your promise?

37:08.080 --> 37:09.080
Let me ask something.

37:09.780 --> 37:10.780
Go ahead.

37:14.105 --> 37:16.305
Who, in North Liang Army,
do you think wants to kill me?

37:19.605 --> 37:20.624
If you die,

37:21.405 --> 37:23.181
who will wield the military power,
except your younger brother?

37:23.205 --> 37:24.305
My father

37:24.655 --> 37:25.824
has six adopted sons.

37:26.230 --> 37:28.470
They're all appointed
to important positions in the army.

37:31.280 --> 37:32.280
I'm afraid

37:32.780 --> 37:34.505
one of them wants to kill you.

37:36.455 --> 37:38.065
So, I'm in danger for the moment.

37:39.630 --> 37:40.664
It's none of my business.

37:41.630 --> 37:42.630
How about this?

37:43.030 --> 37:44.510
Be my bodyguard for a couple of days.

37:44.930 --> 37:46.805
But many masters work for your family.

37:54.880 --> 37:56.184
If you serve as my bodyguard,

37:57.705 --> 37:59.184
you can stay in Tingchao Pavilion

37:59.880 --> 38:01.224
as long

38:01.955 --> 38:03.264
as you want.

38:13.930 --> 38:14.945
Deal.

38:19.248 --> 38:22.272
(Chu Lushan, Xu Xiao's adopted son)

38:32.480 --> 38:34.080
I'll grill it tonight.

38:35.280 --> 38:36.401
Add some salt

38:36.425 --> 38:37.425
and it'll taste better.

38:37.605 --> 38:38.705
I've got the salt ready.

38:38.945 --> 38:40.441
A pinch of salt makes it smell good

38:40.465 --> 38:41.505
and gives you strength.

38:42.805 --> 38:44.506
You used to be too lazy to eat perch.

38:44.530 --> 38:45.531
As for carp like this,

38:45.555 --> 38:47.330
you never ate any.

38:47.855 --> 38:49.755
You never tried the grilled fish
Old Huang made.

38:50.105 --> 38:51.105
Delicious.

38:51.905 --> 38:54.355
What exactly have you suffered
in the past three years?

38:55.280 --> 38:56.380
He deserved it.

39:11.555 --> 39:12.715
It appeared in the wine shop.

39:12.980 --> 39:14.264
White Eagle from Jinzhou?

39:15.130 --> 39:16.130
You're sharp-eyed.

39:16.230 --> 39:17.790
I've been raising it since it was born.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.865
It's priceless.

39:20.505 --> 39:22.581
It's a six-year-old eagle
of the best quality.

39:22.605 --> 39:23.720
I won't sell it. Not at any price.

39:23.744 --> 39:26.505
(Chu Lushan arrived at the Mansion,
asking to see you, Your Highness.)

39:32.580 --> 39:34.264
Chu Lushan asked to see me.

39:37.780 --> 39:39.624
He's one of my father's adopted sons.

39:49.480 --> 39:50.545
Go on with the fishing.

39:51.555 --> 39:52.555
Your Highness!

39:52.830 --> 39:53.830
Your Highness!

39:54.280 --> 39:55.344
Your Highness!

39:55.605 --> 39:57.105
Your Highness, where are you?

39:58.065 --> 39:59.065
Your Highness!

39:59.555 --> 40:00.905
Your Highness!

40:01.680 --> 40:02.824
Your Highness!

40:03.080 --> 40:04.080
Your Highness!

40:04.105 --> 40:05.105
Your Highness!

40:05.355 --> 40:06.355
Your Highness!

40:07.205 --> 40:08.320
I meet you, at last.

40:08.344 --> 40:09.425
Your Highness.

40:09.605 --> 40:10.605
Your Highness,

40:11.630 --> 40:12.630
in the past three years,

40:13.224 --> 40:14.865
I've been thinking of you day and night

40:15.505 --> 40:16.955
with no appetite for anything.

40:22.630 --> 40:23.921
No appetite for anything?

40:23.945 --> 40:24.945
Yes.

40:26.005 --> 40:27.264
But why do I think

40:27.304 --> 40:28.806
you're far fatter?

40:28.830 --> 40:29.905
I'm sure I'm thinner.

40:30.105 --> 40:31.344
A lot thinner.

40:31.980 --> 40:33.155
If you don't believe me,

40:33.355 --> 40:34.555
I'll weigh myself immediately.

40:34.605 --> 40:36.041
If I get one catty heavier,
I'll cut one catty of my flesh off.

40:36.065 --> 40:37.506
If I get ten catties heavier,
I'll cut ten catties of my flesh off.

40:37.530 --> 40:39.240
What do I need your flesh for?

40:39.264 --> 40:40.680
You can feed dogs with it.

40:40.980 --> 40:42.930
You're indeed a good buddy, General Chu.

40:43.480 --> 40:44.521
Call me Fatty Lushan.

40:44.545 --> 40:45.730
That's not appropriate.

40:46.305 --> 40:47.380
Why is it not?

40:47.530 --> 40:49.205
I'm fatty, after all.

40:52.430 --> 40:53.430
Your Highness.

40:55.255 --> 40:56.705
In the past three years,

40:56.855 --> 40:57.880
I'm afraid

40:58.905 --> 41:00.344
you've seldom visited the brothels.

41:03.655 --> 41:05.130
What's your point?

41:07.385 --> 41:10.065
There came a new belle in Zijin Brothel.

41:10.980 --> 41:12.780
She's gorgeous and talented.

41:12.805 --> 41:14.285
She's especially good at sword dance.

41:15.780 --> 41:16.980
Her elegance...

41:17.830 --> 41:18.930
Her appearance...

41:20.530 --> 41:22.705
She's almost
the most beautiful lady in Lingzhou.

41:23.430 --> 41:24.430
She just arrived.

41:25.105 --> 41:28.330
She'll be ready when you are.

41:29.655 --> 41:30.906
She can do sword dance?

41:30.930 --> 41:31.930
Yeah.

41:32.380 --> 41:33.380
Her waist...

41:33.730 --> 41:34.704
Her legs...

41:34.744 --> 41:36.580
Your Highness, are you available now?

41:38.080 --> 41:39.580
How shall I put it?

41:39.905 --> 41:40.905
What?

41:41.730 --> 41:43.505
I came here for fishing.

41:43.865 --> 41:44.955
As I fished,

41:45.455 --> 41:46.655
you came.

41:47.255 --> 41:48.255
How about...?

41:48.280 --> 41:50.305
How about going there after fishing?

41:50.605 --> 41:51.605
Don't bother.

41:52.030 --> 41:53.190
I've got the fish I expected.

41:57.430 --> 41:59.155
Don't visit a brothel, Longxiang.

41:59.705 --> 42:00.800
Come back tonight.

42:00.824 --> 42:01.761
I will.

42:01.785 --> 42:03.905
I'll have Old Huang
make some grilled fish for dinner.

42:05.355 --> 42:06.475
I'd like to catch more fish.

42:09.030 --> 42:10.270
Do you mind visiting a brothel?

42:13.180 --> 42:14.180
I don't.

42:16.784 --> 42:18.355
Old Huang, you're old enough.

42:18.385 --> 42:19.505
You'd better not go.

42:22.955 --> 42:24.330
Who's this?

42:24.530 --> 42:25.545
My new bodyguard.

42:25.805 --> 42:26.720
Look at her appearance.

42:26.744 --> 42:27.744
New bodyguard?

42:29.230 --> 42:30.856
You really have a lot of fun.

42:30.880 --> 42:32.081
Don't talk nonsense.

42:32.105 --> 42:33.200
If she beats you,

42:33.224 --> 42:33.985
I can't stop her.

42:34.030 --> 42:35.030
Let's go.

42:35.655 --> 42:37.521
When I visited Zijin Brothel last time,

42:37.545 --> 42:39.585
the fruit there was stale.

42:39.624 --> 42:40.930
Let's not have any fruit there.

42:41.905 --> 42:42.905
I'll take some with us.

42:45.230 --> 42:46.945
You're a general of sub-third rank.

42:47.105 --> 42:48.082
In front of you,

42:48.106 --> 42:49.160
I'm nothing.

42:49.184 --> 42:49.955
Don't say that.

42:50.180 --> 42:51.240
You don't need to take the fruit.

42:51.264 --> 42:52.664
Let's have someone else go with us.

42:58.130 --> 42:59.555
I'm not going to the brothel.

44:56.905 --> 45:01.005
♪ The flower of pain ♪
